o se na\u010d\u00edst protokoly fronty"],"Failed to fetch queue stats":["Nepoda\u0159ilo se na\u010d\u00edst statistiky fronty"],"Failed to retry item":["Nepoda\u0159ilo se zkusit polo\u017eku znovu"],"Failed to retry items":["Nepoda\u0159ilo se zkusit polo\u017eky znovu"],"Failed to delete queue item":["Nepoda\u0159ilo se smazat polo\u017eku fronty"],"Failed to delete queue items":["Nepoda\u0159ilo se smazat polo\u017eky fronty"],"Failed to fetch settings":["Nepoda\u0159ilo se na\u010d\u00edst nastaven\u00ed"],"Failed to save settings":["Nepoda\u0159ilo se ulo\u017eit nastaven\u00ed"],"Authentication":["Ov\u011b\u0159en\u00ed"],"Syncing lists, tags, and custom fields\u2026":["Synchronizuji seznamy, zna\u010dky a vlastn\u00ed pole\u2026"],"Lists and tags synced successfully!":["Seznamy a zna\u010dky byly \u00fasp\u011b\u0161n\u011b synchronizov\u00e1ny!"],"Custom fields synced successfully!":["Vlastn\u00ed pole byla \u00fasp\u011b\u0161n\u011b synchronizov\u00e1na!"],"Capture leads with forms":["Zachy\u0165te z\u00e1jemce pomoc\u00ed formul\u00e1\u0159\u016f"],"Beautiful popups, inline forms, and landing pages that convert WordPress visitors into subscribers.":["Kr\u00e1sn\u00e9 vyskakovac\u00ed okna, in-line formul\u00e1\u0159e a vstupn\u00ed str\u00e1nky, kter\u00e9 p\u0159etv\u00e1\u0159ej\u00ed n\u00e1v\u0161t\u011bvn\u00edky WordPress na p\u0159edplatitele."],"Don\u2019t miss out":["Nenechte si uj\u00edt"],"Subscribe to get our weekly drops & member-only deals.":["P\u0159ihlaste se a z\u00edskejte na\u0161e t\u00fddenn\u00ed novinky a nab\u00eddky pouze pro \u010dleny."],"Send campaigns that land":["Odes\u00edlejte kampan\u011b, kter\u00e9 zas\u00e1hnou"],"Drag-and-drop email editor with 60+ templates. Send broadcasts, newsletters, and product updates.":["Editor e-mail\u016f s p\u0159etahov\u00e1n\u00edm a 60+ \u0161ablonami. Odes\u00edlejte vys\u00edl\u00e1n\u00ed, zpravodaje a aktualizace produkt\u016f."],"New drop":["Nov\u00fd drop"],"Cart back":["N\u00e1vrat ko\u0161\u00edku"],"Welcome":["V\u00edtejte"],"Automate your workflow":["Automatizujte sv\u016fj pracovn\u00ed postup"],"Welcome series, abandoned carts, post-purchase follow-ups \u2014 running on autopilot.":["V\u00edtejte v s\u00e9rii, opu\u0161t\u011bn\u00e9 ko\u0161\u00edky, n\u00e1sledn\u00e9 akce po n\u00e1kupu \u2014 b\u011b\u017e\u00ed na autopilota."],"Signup":["Registrace"],"Wait 3d":["\u010cekejte 3d"],"Offer":["Nab\u00eddka"],"Built-in lightweight CRM":["Vestav\u011bn\u00fd lehk\u00fd CRM"],"Custom fields, tags, segments and a full activity timeline for every contact you collect.":["Vlastn\u00ed pole, \u0161t\u00edtky, segmenty a pln\u00e1 \u010dasov\u00e1 osa aktivit pro ka\u017ed\u00e9ho kontaktu, kter\u00e9ho z\u00edsk\u00e1te."],"E-commerce integration":["Integrace e-commerce"],"Seamlessly integrate with WooCommerce, SureCart, and Easy Digital Downloads for complete customer insights.":["Bezprobl\u00e9mov\u00e1 integrace s WooCommerce, SureCart a Easy Digital Downloads pro \u00fapln\u00e9 informace o z\u00e1kazn\u00edc\u00edch."],"Secure & GDPR-ready":["Zabezpe\u010den\u00e9 a p\u0159ipraven\u00e9 na GDPR"],"OAuth-based auth, encrypted connections, double opt-in, and full consent management built in.":["Autentizace zalo\u017een\u00e1 na OAuth, \u0161ifrovan\u00e1 spojen\u00ed, dvojit\u00e9 potvrzen\u00ed a pln\u00e9 \u0159\u00edzen\u00ed souhlasu vestav\u011bn\u00e9."],"Authentication failed":["Ov\u011b\u0159en\u00ed selhalo"],"Please try again. If the problem persists, contact support.":["Zkuste to pros\u00edm znovu. Pokud probl\u00e9m p\u0159etrv\u00e1v\u00e1, kontaktujte podporu."],"Email marketing & CRM ":["E-mailov\u00fd marketing a CRM "],"built for WordPress":["postaveno pro WordPress"],"Turn your WordPress visitors into customers. Capture leads with forms, sync contacts in real-time, and send beautiful campaigns \u2014 all without leaving your dashboard.":["P\u0159evra\u0165te sv\u00e9 n\u00e1v\u0161t\u011bvn\u00edky WordPressu na z\u00e1kazn\u00edky. Z\u00edskejte potenci\u00e1ln\u00ed z\u00e1kazn\u00edky pomoc\u00ed formul\u00e1\u0159\u016f, synchronizujte kontakty v re\u00e1ln\u00e9m \u010dase a pos\u00edlejte kr\u00e1sn\u00e9 kampan\u011b \u2014 v\u0161e bez opu\u0161t\u011bn\u00ed va\u0161eho \u0159\u00edd\u00edc\u00edho panelu."],"Already have an account?":["Ji\u017e m\u00e1te \u00fa\u010det?"],"Sign in":["P\u0159ihl\u00e1sit se"],"SureContact overview video":["P\u0159ehled videa SureContact"],"Features":["Funkce"],"What if email marketing was ":["Co kdyby byl e-mailov\u00fd marketing "],"actually easy":["skute\u010dn\u011b jednoduch\u00fd"],"?":["?"],"SureContact gives you everything you need to grow a list, send beautiful emails, and automate your follow-ups \u2014 natively inside WordPress.":["SureContact v\u00e1m poskytuje v\u0161e, co pot\u0159ebujete, abyste dorostli seznam, pos\u00edlali kr\u00e1sn\u00e9 e-maily a automatizovali sv\u00e9 n\u00e1sledn\u00e9 akce \u2014 nativn\u011b uvnit\u0159 WordPressu."],"Get started in minutes":["Za\u010dn\u011bte za p\u00e1r minut"],"How it works":["Jak to funguje"],"From plugin activation to your first campaign \u2014 three steps, no friction.":["Od aktivace pluginu po va\u0161i prvn\u00ed kampa\u0148 \u2014 t\u0159i kroky, \u017e\u00e1dn\u00e9 t\u0159en\u00ed."],"Confirm your details":["Potvr\u010fte sv\u00e9 \u00fadaje"],"Your name, email, and site URL are auto-filled from WordPress. Just confirm and continue \u2014 no signup form to fight with.":["Va\u0161e jm\u00e9no, e-mail a URL webu jsou automaticky vypln\u011bny z WordPressu. Jen potvr\u010fte a pokra\u010dujte \u2014 \u017e\u00e1dn\u00fd registra\u010dn\u00ed formul\u00e1\u0159 k boji."],"Sync your contacts":["Synchronizujte sv\u00e9 kontakty"],"SureContact pulls in existing WP users, WooCommerce customers, and form submissions automatically. Two-way sync keeps everything fresh.":["SureContact automaticky na\u010d\u00edt\u00e1 existuj\u00edc\u00ed u\u017eivatele WP, z\u00e1kazn\u00edky WooCommerce a odeslan\u00e9 formul\u00e1\u0159e. Dvoustrann\u00e1 synchronizace udr\u017euje v\u0161e aktu\u00e1ln\u00ed."],"Send your first campaign":["Ode\u0161lete svou prvn\u00ed kampa\u0148"],"Pick a template, drag in a few blocks, hit send. Or set up a welcome automation that runs while you sleep.":["Vyberte \u0161ablonu, p\u0159et\u00e1hn\u011bte n\u011bkolik blok\u016f, stiskn\u011bte odeslat. Nebo nastavte automatizaci pro uv\u00edt\u00e1n\u00ed, kter\u00e1 b\u011b\u017e\u00ed, zat\u00edmco sp\u00edte."],"Integrations":["Integrace"],"SureContact ":["SureContact "],"already works":["u\u017e funguje"]," with your favorite WordPress plugins":[" s va\u0161imi obl\u00edben\u00fdmi pluginy WordPressu"],"Connect once. Sync everything. Out-of-the-box integrations with every major form, commerce, and theme plugin in the WordPress ecosystem.":["P\u0159ipojte jednou. Synchronizujte v\u0161echno. Integrovan\u00e9 \u0159e\u0161en\u00ed se v\u0161emi hlavn\u00edmi formul\u00e1\u0159i, obchodn\u00edmi a t\u00e9matick\u00fdmi pluginy v ekosyst\u00e9mu WordPressu."],"+ %d more native integrations":["+ %d dal\u0161\u00edch nativn\u00edch integrac\u00ed"],"Testimonials":["Ohlasy"],"Trusted by WordPress teams worldwide":["D\u016fv\u011b\u0159ov\u00e1no t\u00fdmy WordPressu po cel\u00e9m sv\u011bt\u011b"],"Over 12M+ sites use Brainstorm Force plugins to ship faster.":["V\u00edce ne\u017e 12M+ web\u016f pou\u017e\u00edv\u00e1 pluginy Brainstorm Force pro rychlej\u0161\u00ed dod\u00e1vku."],"SureContact User":["U\u017eivatel SureContact"],"SureContact is on another level. I love that the heavy lifting happens outside WordPress, and the connector syncing multiple sites into one dashboard is exactly what I needed. I\u2019ve finally ditched MailerLite.":["SureContact je na jin\u00e9 \u00farovni. Miluji, \u017ee t\u011b\u017ek\u00e1 pr\u00e1ce prob\u00edh\u00e1 mimo WordPress a konektor synchronizuj\u00edc\u00ed v\u00edce web\u016f do jednoho \u0159\u00eddic\u00edho panelu je p\u0159esn\u011b to, co jsem pot\u0159eboval. Nakonec jsem se zbavil MailerLite."],"Founder, Hillman Academy":["Zakladatel, Hillman Academy"],"You guys are the GOAT! The speed of implementation is unchallenged to any other software provider I\u2019ve ever used. Simply Amazing! Thanks, I\u2019ll get started with setting everything up using Mailersend now.":["Jste nejlep\u0161\u00ed! Rychlost implementace nem\u00e1 konkurenci mezi jak\u00fdmkoli jin\u00fdm poskytovatelem softwaru, kter\u00e9ho jsem kdy pou\u017e\u00edval. Naprosto \u00fa\u017easn\u00e9! D\u011bkuji, nyn\u00ed za\u010dnu s nastaven\u00ed v\u0161eho pomoc\u00ed Mailersend."],"Founder, EDITO Sarl":["Zakladatel, EDITO Sarl"],"Incredibly fast and responsive support. List-Unsubscribe and List-Unsubscribe-Post headers were implemented immediately, and everything worked perfectly in testing.":["Neskute\u010dn\u011b rychl\u00e1 a reaguj\u00edc\u00ed podpora. Hlavi\u010dky List-Unsubscribe a List-Unsubscribe-Post byly implementov\u00e1ny ihned a v\u0161e fungovalo perfektn\u011b p\u0159i testov\u00e1n\u00ed."],"SureContact\u2019s connector-based implementation is way better than MailerPress. No comparison.":["Implementace zalo\u017een\u00e1 na konektoru SureContact je mnohem lep\u0161\u00ed ne\u017e MailerPress. Nen\u00ed to srovn\u00e1n\u00ed."],"Demo Queen":["Demonstr\u00e1torka"],"I expected SureContact to be a nice-to-have. 67 minutes later, I loved it. It feels like OttoKit\u2019s answer to email.":["O\u010dek\u00e1val jsem, \u017ee SureContact bude jen p\u0159\u00edjemn\u00fdm dopl\u0148kem. O 67 minut pozd\u011bji jsem ho miloval. C\u00edt\u00ed se jako odpov\u011b\u010f OttoKit na e-mail."],"Does exactly what it promises. The focus is squarely on conversion and user experience. The team behind the plugin consistently proves they understand entrepreneurial needs, and their support is top-tier.":["D\u011bl\u00e1 p\u0159esn\u011b to, co slibuje. Zam\u011b\u0159en\u00ed je p\u0159\u00edmo na konverzi a u\u017eivatelskou zku\u0161enost. T\u00fdm za pluginem neust\u00e1le dokazuje, \u017ee rozum\u00ed pot\u0159eb\u00e1m podnikatel\u016f, a jejich podpora je \u0161pi\u010dkov\u00e1."],"Trusted by 12M+ businesses":["D\u016fv\u011b\u0159ov\u00e1no 12M+ firmami"],"Ready to grow your list?":["Jste p\u0159ipraveni roz\u0161\u00ed\u0159it sv\u016fj seznam?"],"Join 12M+ WordPress sites already using SureContact to capture, nurture, and convert their visitors.":["P\u0159ipojte se k 12M+ web\u016fm WordPressu, kter\u00e9 ji\u017e pou\u017e\u00edvaj\u00ed SureContact k zachycen\u00ed, p\u011bstov\u00e1n\u00ed a konverzi sv\u00fdch n\u00e1v\u0161t\u011bvn\u00edk\u016f."],"Get started":["Za\u010dn\u011bte"],"Select an option":["Vyberte mo\u017enost"],"Select lists\u2026":["Vyberte seznamy\u2026"],"Select tags\u2026":["Vyberte \u0161t\u00edtky\u2026"],"Add":["P\u0159idat"],"No items added yet. Click \"Add\" to create your first entry.":["Zat\u00edm nebyly p\u0159id\u00e1ny \u017e\u00e1dn\u00e9 polo\u017eky. Klikn\u011bte na \"P\u0159idat\", abyste vytvo\u0159ili sv\u016fj prvn\u00ed z\u00e1znam."],"Item %d":["Polo\u017eka %d"],"Remove item":["Odebrat polo\u017eku"],"%1$s for item %2$d":["%1$s pro polo\u017eku %2$d"],"No form fields available to map":["Nen\u00ed k dispozici \u017e\u00e1dn\u00e9 pole formul\u00e1\u0159e k mapov\u00e1n\u00ed"],"Form Field":["Pole formul\u00e1\u0159e"],"CRM Field":["Pole CRM"],"Select CRM field for %s":["Vyberte pole CRM pro %s"],"No configuration required.":["Nen\u00ed vy\u017eadov\u00e1na \u017e\u00e1dn\u00e1 konfigurace."],"Text":["Text"],"Number":["\u010c\u00edslo"],"Date":["Datum"],"Timestamp":["\u010casov\u00e9 raz\u00edtko"],"URL":["URL"],"Dropdown":["Roletka"],"Multi-Select":["V\u00edce v\u00fdb\u011br"],"Checkbox":["Za\u0161krt\u00e1vac\u00ed pol\u00ed\u010dko"],"Text Area":["Textov\u00e1 oblast"],"Field slug is required.":["Slug pole je povinn\u00fd."],"Slug can only contain lowercase letters, numbers, and underscores.":["Slug m\u016f\u017ee obsahovat pouze mal\u00e9 p\u00edsmena, \u010d\u00edsla a podtr\u017e\u00edtka."],"At least one option is required.":["Je vy\u017eadov\u00e1na alespo\u0148 jedna mo\u017enost."],"Field Label":["Popis pole"],"e.g., Company Size":["nap\u0159. Velikost spole\u010dnosti"],"Field Slug":["Slug pole"],"e.g., company_size":["nap\u0159. velikost_spole\u010dnosti"],"Unique identifier for this field. Only lowercase letters, numbers, and underscores.":["Unik\u00e1tn\u00ed identifik\u00e1tor pro toto pole. Pouze mal\u00e1 p\u00edsmena, \u010d\u00edsla a podtr\u017e\u00edtka."],"Field Type":["Typ pole"],"Required Field":["Povinn\u00e9 pole"],"Make this field mandatory when creating contacts.":["Ud\u011blejte toto pole povinn\u00fdm p\u0159i vytv\u00e1\u0159en\u00ed kontakt\u016f."],"Mark field as required":["Ozna\u010dit pole jako povinn\u00e9"],"Options":["Mo\u017enosti"],"Option":["Mo\u017enost"],"Remove option":["Odebrat mo\u017enost"],"Add Option":["P\u0159idat mo\u017enost"],"Cancel":["Zru\u0161it"],"Creating\u2026":["Vytv\u00e1\u0159\u00ed se\u2026"],"Create Field":["Vytvo\u0159it pole"],"Select Option":["Vybrat mo\u017enost"],"Search fields\u2026":["Hledat pole\u2026"],"Select CRM field":["Vybrat pole CRM"],"Last sync: %s":["Posledn\u00ed synchronizace: %s"],"Error syncing fields":["Chyba p\u0159i synchronizaci pol\u00ed"],"Contact Fields":["Pole kontakt\u016f"],"Custom Fields":["Vlastn\u00ed pole"],"Loading\u2026":["Na\u010d\u00edt\u00e1 se\u2026"],"No fields found for":["Nebyly nalezeny \u017e\u00e1dn\u00e1 pole pro"],"Create":["Vytvo\u0159it"],"Create Custom Field":["Vytvo\u0159it vlastn\u00ed pole"],"Pull Custom Fields":["Na\u010d\u00edst vlastn\u00ed pole"],"Something went wrong":["N\u011bco se pokazilo"],"We're sorry, but something unexpected happened. Please try refreshing the page.":["Omlouv\u00e1me se, ale do\u0161lo k n\u011b\u010demu neo\u010dek\u00e1van\u00e9mu. Zkuste pros\u00edm aktualizovat str\u00e1nku."],"Try Again":["Zkusit znovu"],"Reload Page":["Obnovit str\u00e1nku"],"Error Details (Development Mode)":["Podrobnosti o chyb\u011b (v\u00fdvojov\u00fd re\u017eim)"],"Error:":["Chyba:"],"Component Stack:":["Z\u00e1sobn\u00edk komponent:"],"There was an error loading the %s page. Please try refreshing the page.":["Do\u0161lo k chyb\u011b p\u0159i na\u010d\u00edt\u00e1n\u00ed str\u00e1nky %s. Zkuste pros\u00edm aktualizovat str\u00e1nku."],"Oops! Something went wrong":["Promi\u0148te! N\u011bco se pokazilo"],"We encountered an error while loading the %s page. This might be a temporary issue.":["Narazili jsme na chybu p\u0159i na\u010d\u00edt\u00e1n\u00ed str\u00e1nky %s. M\u016f\u017ee to b\u00fdt do\u010dasn\u00fd probl\u00e9m."],"Refresh Page":["Obnovit str\u00e1nku"],"Error loading %s":["Chyba p\u0159i na\u010d\u00edt\u00e1n\u00ed %s"],"Unable to load %s":["Nelze na\u010d\u00edst %s"],"There was an error loading the %s. Please try again.":["P\u0159i na\u010d\u00edt\u00e1n\u00ed %s do\u0161lo k chyb\u011b. Zkuste to pros\u00edm znovu."],"Failed to load %s. Please check your connection and try again.":["Na\u010dten\u00ed %s se nezda\u0159ilo. Zkontrolujte sv\u00e9 p\u0159ipojen\u00ed a zkuste to znovu."],"We're having trouble loading the %s. This could be due to a network issue or server problem.":["M\u00e1me probl\u00e9my s na\u010d\u00edt\u00e1n\u00edm %s. To m\u016f\u017ee b\u00fdt zp\u016fsobeno probl\u00e9mem s\u00edt\u011b nebo serverem."],"Retry":["Zkusit znovu"],"Search lists\u2026":["Hledat seznamy\u2026"],"Select lists":["Vybrat seznamy"],"Error syncing lists and tags":["Chyba synchronizace seznam\u016f a \u0161t\u00edtk\u016f"],"List \"%s\" created successfully!":["Seznam \"%s\" byl \u00fasp\u011b\u0161n\u011b vytvo\u0159en!"],"No lists found for":["Nebyl nalezen \u017e\u00e1dn\u00fd seznam pro"],"No lists available":["\u017d\u00e1dn\u00e9 seznamy k dispozici"],"Sync Lists & Tags":["Synchronizovat seznamy a \u0161t\u00edtky"],"Bulk Sync":["Hromadn\u00e1 synchronizace"],"Settings":["Nastaven\u00ed"],"Logs":["Z\u00e1znamy"],