reate Account & Connect":["Vytvo\u0159it \u00fa\u010det a p\u0159ipojit se"],"Search tags\u2026":["Hledat \u0161t\u00edtky\u2026"],"Select tags":["Vybrat \u0161t\u00edtky"],"Tag \"%s\" created successfully!":["\u0160t\u00edtek \"%s\" byl \u00fasp\u011b\u0161n\u011b vytvo\u0159en!"],"No tags found for":["Nena\u0161ly se \u017e\u00e1dn\u00e9 \u0161t\u00edtky pro"],"No tags available":["\u017d\u00e1dn\u00e9 \u0161t\u00edtky k dispozici"],"Enabling %s\u2026":["Povolov\u00e1n\u00ed %s\u2026"],"Disabling %s\u2026":["Zakazov\u00e1n\u00ed %s\u2026"],"Integration":["Integrace"],"%s enabled successfully":["%s bylo \u00fasp\u011b\u0161n\u011b povoleno"],"%s disabled successfully":["%s bylo \u00fasp\u011b\u0161n\u011b zak\u00e1z\u00e1no"],"Settings saved successfully":["Nastaven\u00ed byla \u00fasp\u011b\u0161n\u011b ulo\u017eena"],"Item queued for retry":["Polo\u017eka za\u0159azena k op\u011btovn\u00e9mu pokusu"],"Logs deleted":["Z\u00e1znamy byly smaz\u00e1ny"],"Items queued for retry":["Polo\u017eky za\u0159azeny k op\u011btovn\u00e9mu pokusu"],"All failed items queued for retry":["V\u0161echny ne\u00fasp\u011b\u0161n\u00e9 polo\u017eky \u010dekaj\u00ed na op\u011btovn\u00e9 pokusy"],"Logs cleared":["Protokoly byly vymaz\u00e1ny"],"Create a new custom field in your SureContact CRM.":["Vytvo\u0159te nov\u00e9 vlastn\u00ed pole ve va\u0161em SureContact CRM."],"Contact Fields Mapping":["Mapov\u00e1n\u00ed pol\u00ed kontakt\u016f"],"Configure field mappings between WordPress and SureContact":["Nastavte mapov\u00e1n\u00ed pol\u00ed mezi WordPress a SureContact"],"Saving\u2026":["Ukl\u00e1d\u00e1n\u00ed\u2026"],"Save Changes":["Ulo\u017eit zm\u011bny"],"Syncing\u2026":["Synchronizuji\u2026"],"Enable sync for %s":["Povolit synchronizaci pro %s"],"Type:":["Typ:"],"SureContact Field:":["Pole SureContact:"],"Map %s to SureContact field":["Mapujte %s na pole SureContact"],"Field Mapping Guide":["Pr\u016fvodce mapov\u00e1n\u00edm pol\u00ed"],"Only fields that are marked as \"Active\" (Sync enabled) will be synchronized to your CRM. Map WordPress fields to corresponding CRM fields using the dropdowns below.":["Pouze pole ozna\u010den\u00e1 jako \"Aktivn\u00ed\" (synchronizace povolena) budou synchronizov\u00e1na do va\u0161eho CRM. Mapujte pole WordPress na odpov\u00eddaj\u00edc\u00ed pole CRM pomoc\u00ed n\u00ed\u017ee uveden\u00fdch rozbalovac\u00edch nab\u00eddek."],"Error saving mappings":["Chyba p\u0159i ukl\u00e1d\u00e1n\u00ed mapov\u00e1n\u00ed"],"Field \"%s\" is now available.":["Pole \"%s\" je nyn\u00ed k dispozici."],"Error creating custom field":["Chyba p\u0159i vytv\u00e1\u0159en\u00ed vlastn\u00edho pole"],"%s field mappings":["%s mapov\u00e1n\u00ed pol\u00ed"],"WordPress Field":["Pole WordPress"],"Type":["Typ"],"SureContact Field":["Pole SureContact"],"Sync":["Synchronizace"],"Error Loading Data":["Chyba p\u0159i na\u010d\u00edt\u00e1n\u00ed dat"],"Failed to load field mapping data. Please refresh the page and try again.":["Nepoda\u0159ilo se na\u010d\u00edst data mapov\u00e1n\u00ed pol\u00ed. Pros\u00edm, obnovte str\u00e1nku a zkuste to znovu."],"Disconnect failed":["Odpojen\u00ed se nezda\u0159ilo"],"Disconnected":["Odpojeno"],"You have been disconnected.":["Byli jste odpojeni."],"Disconnect Failed":["Odpojen\u00ed se nezda\u0159ilo"],"Unable to disconnect":["Nelze se odpojit"],"VIP Support":["VIP podpora"],"Help Center":["Centrum n\u00e1pov\u011bdy"],"Join the Community":["P\u0159ipojte se k komunit\u011b"],"Rate Us":["Ohodno\u0165te n\u00e1s"],"Welcome to SureContact":["V\u00edtejte v SureContact"],"SureContact is a comprehensive CRM platform that helps you manage customer relationships and data effectively. Connect your WordPress site to centralize customer information, track interactions, and streamline your business operations.":["SureContact je komplexn\u00ed CRM platforma, kter\u00e1 v\u00e1m pom\u016f\u017ee efektivn\u011b spravovat vztahy a data z\u00e1kazn\u00edk\u016f. P\u0159ipojte sv\u016fj WordPress web a centralizujte informace o z\u00e1kazn\u00edc\u00edch, sledujte interakce a zjednodu\u0161te sv\u00e9 podnik\u00e1n\u00ed."],"By visiting the CRM, you will be able to see all synced contacts and manage tags, lists, and custom fields. You can create beautiful campaigns and automations, along with many other features. Excited to get started? Please click the button below.":["N\u00e1v\u0161t\u011bvou CRM budete moci vid\u011bt v\u0161echny synchronizovan\u00e9 kontakty a spravovat \u0161t\u00edtky, seznamy a vlastn\u00ed pole. M\u016f\u017eete vytv\u00e1\u0159et kr\u00e1sn\u00e9 kampan\u011b a automatizace spolu s mnoha dal\u0161\u00edmi funkcemi. T\u011b\u0161\u00edte se na za\u010d\u00e1tek? Klikn\u011bte na tla\u010d\u00edtko n\u00ed\u017ee."],"Visit CRM":["Nav\u0161t\u00edvit CRM"],"Read Full Guide":["P\u0159e\u010d\u00edst cel\u00e9ho pr\u016fvodce"],"Watch SureContact overview video":["Sledovat p\u0159ehledov\u00e9 video SureContact"],"Connection Status":["Stav p\u0159ipojen\u00ed"],"Your site is connected to SureContact":["Va\u0161e str\u00e1nka je p\u0159ipojena k SureContact"],"Connected":["P\u0159ipojeno"],"Disconnect":["Odpojit"],"Quick Access":["Rychl\u00fd p\u0159\u00edstup"],"Disconnect from SureContact?":["Odebrat p\u0159ipojen\u00ed k SureContact?"],"This will remove authentication and cached SureContact data from WordPress. You can reconnect anytime.":["T\u00edmto odstran\u00edte ov\u011b\u0159en\u00ed a vyrovnan\u00e1 data SureContact z WordPressu. M\u016f\u017eete se kdykoli znovu p\u0159ipojit."],"Are you sure you want to disconnect your WordPress site from SureContact? This action will remove all cached data and authentication tokens.":["Jste si jisti, \u017ee chcete odpojit sv\u016fj WordPress web od SureContact? Tato akce odstran\u00ed v\u0161echna vyrovnan\u00e1 data a tokeny ov\u011b\u0159en\u00ed."],"Disconnecting\u2026":["Odpojuji\u2026"],"Important Note:":["D\u016fle\u017eit\u00e1 pozn\u00e1mka:"],"Make sure to go to the Contact Fields tab first, match your plugin fields with the corresponding CRM fields, and mark them as Active. After completing this step, return here and then enable the additional settings below. If you do not complete this step, the settings below will not work as expected, and your contacts will not sync with the SureContact CRM.":["Nezapome\u0148te nejprve p\u0159ej\u00edt na kartu Pol\u00ed kontakt\u016f, sladit pole va\u0161eho pluginu s odpov\u00eddaj\u00edc\u00edmi poli CRM a ozna\u010dit je jako Aktivn\u00ed. Po dokon\u010den\u00ed tohoto kroku se vra\u0165te sem a povolte n\u00ed\u017ee uveden\u00e1 dodate\u010dn\u00e1 nastaven\u00ed. Pokud tento krok nedokon\u010d\u00edte, n\u00ed\u017ee uveden\u00e1 nastaven\u00ed nebudou fungovat podle o\u010dek\u00e1v\u00e1n\u00ed a va\u0161e kontakty se nesynchronizuj\u00ed s CRM SureContact."],"Plugin Integrations":["Integrace plugin\u016f"],"Manage integrations with WordPress plugins to sync data to SureContact":["Spravujte integrace s pluginy WordPress pro synchronizaci dat do SureContact"],"Add Integration":["P\u0159idat integraci"],"On %1$s of %2$s":["Na %1$s z %2$s"],"Select %s color":["Vyberte barvu %s"],"Note color: %s. Click to change":["Barva pozn\u00e1mky: %s. Klikn\u011bte pro zm\u011bnu"],"Delete note":["Smazat pozn\u00e1mku"],"Close":["Zav\u0159\u00edt"],"Add note here\u2026":["P\u0159idat pozn\u00e1mku sem\u2026"],"Save":["Ulo\u017eit"],"Enabled":["Povoleno"],"Disabled":["Zak\u00e1z\u00e1no"],"Not Installed":["Nep\u0159enesen"],"Open documentation in new window":["Otev\u0159\u00edt dokumentaci v nov\u00e9m okn\u011b"],"Documentation":["Dokumentace"],"%1$s %2$s integration":["%1$s %2$s integrace"],"Disable":["Zak\u00e1zat"],"Enable":["Povolit"],"Hide settings":["Skr\u00fdt nastaven\u00ed"],"Show settings":["Zobrazit nastaven\u00ed"],"Failed to load integrations":["Na\u010dten\u00ed integrac\u00ed selhalo"],"Loading field mapping\u2026":["Na\u010d\u00edt\u00e1n\u00ed mapov\u00e1n\u00ed pol\u00ed\u2026"],"Plugin Field":["Pole pluginu"]